# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
# Only root modules (envs/*, bootstrap) lock providers; reusable modules inherit the lock
# of the root that calls them, and `terraform validate` in a module creates a stray one.
infra/terraform/modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl

